SUMMARY:PARIS | CUBA - the post-war affair
DESCRIPTION:Reunites artists from the Havana exhibitions of the 1960s\, a
 longside archive material from those events. It traces the Cuban and Fre
 nch avant-garde exchange from 1950s Paris onward.\nhttps://www.galleries
 now.net/shows/paris-cuba/
LOCATION:Hanina Fine Arts\, 21 Woodstock Street\, W1C 2AP\, London West E
 nd\, London
URL:https://www.galleriesnow.net/shows/paris-cuba/
